UPDATE products SET title='QuietWire M320 Wired Quiet Mouse', description='The mouse uses a 1.5-meter braided cable and a fixed 1,200 DPI sensor, with relatively quiet left and right buttons. The body is 10.4 centimeters long, which may feel cramped for users with larger hands.' WHERE rowid=138;
