UPDATE products SET title='PocketBag 20L Foldable Shopping Bag', description='The bag expands to approximately twenty liters, with double stitching added at the handles. The inner pocket can be folded inside out to serve as a storage pouch. Hand-wash in cold water; not suitable for carrying sharp or heavy items.' WHERE rowid=145;
UPDATE products SET title='CableTray Pro Two-Tier Under-Desk Cable Tray', description='The upper tier holds a power strip, while the lower tier stores excess cable length. Each side has three cable outlets. The mounting clamps fit tabletops two to six centimeters thick, and the entire set is rated to support eight kilograms.' WHERE rowid=163;
UPDATE products SET title='MeshPocket Soft Under-Desk Cable Management Bag', description='The breathable mesh bag hangs from the desk beam with four hook-and-loop straps and folds down to the size of an envelope. Suitable for lightweight chargers; do not use it to support large power supplies.' WHERE rowid=183;
UPDATE products SET title='SlimRail Low-Profile Cable Management Tray', description='The tray is only seven centimeters high, with an open front, making it suitable for workstations with limited under-desk space. Includes six adhesive cable clips; the steel tray itself must still be secured with screws.' WHERE rowid=203;
UPDATE products SET title='ClampNest No-Drill Power Cable Basket', description='The cable basket is secured with two desk clamps, one on each side. The bottom is lined with an insulating pad, and the power strip switch remains visible. Not suitable for glass, beveled-edge, or honeycomb-panel tabletops.' WHERE rowid=223;
